# The sulphur jungle over the shoulder: its most characteristic ground at noon,
# then beside a vent (the steam it breathes, the crust it laid), and the evening.
# With the frame cost standing at noon.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/lands_sulphur.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0 --view=shoulder --stats
coast calm
hour 12
place typical_sulphur_jungle
wait 3.0
shot noon with land:sulphur_jungle
perf stats begin
wait 5.0
perf stats end sulphur-noon
near vent
wait 4.0
shot vent with prop:vent
hour 18.5
wait 2.0
shot vent-evening with prop:vent
